程序 whex_heat_equivalence
tolerance 1e-10
輸入 n: u64 range 4..100000000
field u[i 属于 n]: f64 = 0.25 + cast(f64, (i * 17 + 3) % 1024) / 1024.0
每個 i in n {
    next: f64 = u[i] + 0.125 * (u[周期(i + n - 1, n)] - 2.0 * u[i] + u[periodic(i + 1, n)])
}
sum checksum[i 屬於 n]: f64 = next[i]
输出 checksum
test (4) => { checksum = 1.111328125 }
